Step 1: Create Java Project
1. Open Eclipse. 2. Go to File → New → Java Project. 3. Enter project name:
WebElementInteraction
4. Click Finish. Step 2: Add Selenium JAR Files
1. Right-click the project.
2. Select Build Path → Configure Build Path. 3. Select Libraries. 4. Click Classpath → Add External JARs. 5. Select your Selenium JAR files.
6. Click Apply and Close. Step 3: Create HTML Test Page
